{"page":132,"width":1666,"height":2169,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"제1장 기본","words":[{"text":"제1장","x":1329,"y":82,"width":57,"height":26},{"text":"기본","x":1450,"y":82,"width":43,"height":27}]},{"text":"앞서 본 것처럼 테이블에는 등록된 자료들이 있으며, 이 자료들은 삭제하지 않는 한 지속적으로 유지된다. 만약","words":[{"text":"앞서","x":218,"y":219,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"본","x":281,"y":220,"width":26,"height":28},{"text":"것처럼","x":318,"y":219,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"테이블에는","x":406,"y":219,"width":124,"height":30},{"text":"등록된","x":539,"y":219,"width":71,"height":30},{"text":"자료들이","x":622,"y":219,"width":97,"height":30},{"text":"있으며,","x":733,"y":220,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":828,"y":220,"width":22,"height":29},{"text":"자료들은","x":862,"y":220,"width":102,"height":29},{"text":"삭제하지","x":974,"y":220,"width":98,"height":31},{"text":"않는","x":1085,"y":220,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"한","x":1146,"y":219,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"지속적으로","x":1187,"y":219,"width":128,"height":30},{"text":"유지된다.","x":1325,"y":218,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"만약","x":1444,"y":217,"width":52,"height":30}]},{"text":"우리가 자료를 입력하지 않는다면 테이블은 본래 만斟졌을 때부터 갖고 있던 속성을 그대로 유지하면서 존재한다","words":[{"text":"우리가","x":184,"y":268,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"자료를","x":272,"y":267,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"입력하지","x":357,"y":267,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"않는다면","x":468,"y":266,"width":94,"height":30},{"text":"테이블은","x":575,"y":267,"width":96,"height":30},{"text":"본래","x":679,"y":267,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"만斟졌을","x":740,"y":267,"width":124,"height":29},{"text":"때부터","x":875,"y":267,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"갖고","x":959,"y":267,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"있던","x":1020,"y":267,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"속성을","x":1080,"y":267,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"그대로","x":1166,"y":267,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"유지하면서","x":1253,"y":267,"width":125,"height":30},{"text":"존재한다","x":1390,"y":264,"width":101,"height":32}]},{"text":"[표 Ⅱ-1피] 데이터가 있는 경우와 없는 경우","words":[{"text":"[표","x":581,"y":364,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"Ⅱ-1피]","x":628,"y":363,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"데이터가","x":720,"y":362,"width":98,"height":29},{"text":"있는","x":831,"y":362,"width":50,"height":28},{"text":"경우와","x":895,"y":362,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"없는","x":982,"y":362,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"경우","x":1046,"y":363,"width":49,"height":29}]},{"text":"테이블에 데이터가 있는 경우","words":[{"text":"테이블에","x":185,"y":629,"width":93,"height":25},{"text":"데이터가","x":292,"y":626,"width":91,"height":26},{"text":"있는","x":396,"y":627,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"경우","x":454,"y":628,"width":44,"height":24}]},{"text":"테이블에 데이터가 없는 경우","words":[{"text":"테이블에","x":875,"y":628,"width":93,"height":25},{"text":"데이터가","x":983,"y":627,"width":93,"height":25},{"text":"없는","x":1089,"y":626,"width":46,"height":25},{"text":"경우","x":1149,"y":626,"width":46,"height":25}]},{"text":"테이블에 대해 좀 더 상세히 살펴보자. 테이*(TABLE)은 데이터를 저상하는 객체(Obj년)로서 관계형 데이터베","words":[{"text":"테이블에","x":216,"y":716,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"대해","x":327,"y":716,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"좀","x":384,"y":717,"width":26,"height":27},{"text":"더","x":421,"y":715,"width":22,"height":29},{"text":"상세히","x":456,"y":716,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":542,"y":717,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"테이*(TABLE)은","x":657,"y":717,"width":205,"height":32},{"text":"데이터를","x":873,"y":717,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"저상하는","x":984,"y":717,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"객체(Obj년)로서","x":1098,"y":716,"width":201,"height":33},{"text":"관계형","x":1312,"y":717,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"데이터베","x":1400,"y":717,"width":99,"height":29}]},{"text":"이스의 기본 단위다. 관계형 데이터베이스에서는 모든 데이터를 칼럼과 행이라는 2차원 구조로 나타낸다. 세로","words":[{"text":"이스의","x":183,"y":763,"width":72,"height":30},{"text":"기본","x":272,"y":762,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"단위다.","x":335,"y":761,"width":80,"height":29},{"text":"관계형","x":430,"y":762,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"데이터베이스에서는","x":520,"y":762,"width":226,"height":30},{"text":"모든","x":757,"y":765,"width":54,"height":27},{"text":"데이터를","x":824,"y":763,"width":103,"height":29},{"text":"칼럼과","x":941,"y":763,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"행이라는","x":1032,"y":762,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"2차원","x":1148,"y":761,"width":67,"height":30},{"text":"구조로","x":1229,"y":764,"width":80,"height":26},{"text":"나타낸다.","x":1323,"y":762,"width":108,"height":29},{"text":"세로","x":1447,"y":763,"width":52,"height":28}]},{"text":"방향을 칼럼(Column), 가로 방향을 행(Row)이라고 한다. 칼럼과 행이 겹치는 하나의 공〈-卜을 필드(Field)라고","words":[{"text":"방향을","x":182,"y":810,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"칼럼(Column),","x":270,"y":808,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"가로","x":461,"y":808,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"방향을","x":525,"y":808,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"행(Row)이라고","x":611,"y":809,"width":177,"height":31},{"text":"한다.","x":802,"y":809,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"칼럼과","x":875,"y":808,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"행이","x":968,"y":809,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"겹치는","x":1033,"y":808,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"하나의","x":1125,"y":807,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"공〈-卜을","x":1216,"y":808,"width":80,"height":29},{"text":"필드(Field)라고","x":1310,"y":808,"width":189,"height":32}]},{"text":"한다. 선수정보 테이블을 예로 들면, 선수명과 포지션 등의 칼럼이 있고 각 선수에 대한 데이터를 행으로 구성해","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":180,"y":857,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"선수정보","x":251,"y":856,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"테이블을","x":362,"y":854,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"예로","x":472,"y":856,"width":51,"height":28},{"text":"들면,","x":533,"y":855,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"선수명과","x":603,"y":855,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"포지션","x":714,"y":855,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"등의","x":803,"y":855,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"칼럼이","x":866,"y":855,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"있고","x":956,"y":855,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"각","x":1020,"y":855,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"선수에","x":1057,"y":855,"width":78,"height":28},{"text":"대한","x":1149,"y":854,"width":53,"height":28},{"text"